==Battleground==
*10 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*20 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
*1 [[Relic Doge]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*5 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*8 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*2 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*8 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 233.33 seconds<sup>7,000f</sup>, delay 56.67~60 seconds<sup>1,700f~1,800f</sup>.
