**1 [[Othom]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Deathkory]] spawns.
**1 [[Ackey]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Cone Cat]] makes this stage a breeze, so if you have it, use it. [[Ancient Egg: N003 (Special Cat)|Cat Cactus]] and [[Primordial Cat (Rare Cat)|Future Cat]] can be used in tandem as a somewhat effective alternative (you will have to use Research [[Cat Combo|Combo]](s) to spam them quickly). The Cerberus Kids at the beginning will provide enough money to get some decent units out before you trigger the boss fight. The Ackey doesn't spawn immediately after the Othom and Deathkory, so try to kill at least one of them before he spawns. Units such as [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jellycat]] can deal significant damage, and [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] can dish out a ton to Othom if timed right. Use [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] to block Deathkory's [[Wave Attack]]s, with a [[:Category:Shield Piercing Cats|Shield Piercer]] such as [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Evil Aku Researcher]] or [[Ancient Egg: N004 (Special Cat)|Supercar Cat]] to break his [[Shield]]. Luring Deathkory and/or Othom is also a good way to avoid fighting the Ackey for a while longer.

==Trivia==
*Like all [[Bazaar of the Pirate King]] stages, Titanic Steakhouse is named after a movie, in this case ''[[:wikipedia:Titanic (1997 film)|Titanic]]''.

